{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium “Designer Story” section for Esraa Fashion Designer.
    
    Desktop layout:
    Large portrait/lifestyle image on one side and editorial text on the other.
    
    Small label:
    “THE DESIGNER”
    
    Headline:
    “A Feminine Vision of Modern Modesty”
    
    Text:
    “Esraa Fashion Designer creates refined pieces for women who want modest dressing to feel expressive, polished, and unmistakably personal. Every collection balances graceful proportions with rich fabrics and considered detail.”
    
    CTA:
    “Discover Esraa’s Vision”
    
    Design:
    
    * Warm ivory background.
    * Large beautiful photography.
    * Generous whitespace.
    * Elegant serif-style heading.
    * Dark charcoal body text.
    * Burgundy/plum accent details.
    * Soft rounded image corners.
    * Subtle fade-up animation.
    
    Mobile:
    Image first, text underneath.
    Maintain comfortable spacing and readable typography.
    
    Make image, heading, text, CTA label, and link customizable.
    , Create a premium “Designer Story” section for Esraa Fashion Designer.
    
